      "location": {
        "known": true,
        "value": "Belurat Gaol : On the room with the hanging Jars, drop down on them until you will reach one with the item. [ Video Link ]; Belurat Tower Settlement : Can be found on an area of illuminated graves. [ See Shadow of the Erdtree Map ] [ Video Link ]; Ruined Forge Lava Intake : Take the first ladder down, go up the set of stairs on the right, and then use the collapsed column on the left as a makeshift bridge to cross to the other side. Jump to the other side and turn right to find another ladder, climb down, and access the next room. Turn left to find the item on a corpse. [ See Shadow of the Erdtree Map ] [ Video Link ]",
